{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05235","headline":"赠皇甫侍御赴都八首 五 · 元希声","name":"赠皇甫侍御赴都八首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绰绰夫君，是膺柱下。\n准绳有望，名器无假。\n宠盖伯山，气雄公雅。\n立朝正色，俟我能者。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元希声","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05235.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05235","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}